WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:39.550
In the year 2009, humanity
encountered its first alien race.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:44.870
The result was an intergalactic war with a militaristic race of giants called Zentraedi.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.330
The Earth was thrown into what
seemed a never-ending crisis.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:51.520
In the year 2010, March,
the war was brought to an end.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.430
In April of the same year, the New Unity Government was established...

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:58.380
...calling together mankind and Zentraedi into peaceful co-existence.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:04.580
This resulted in a mass micronization of the remaining Zentraedi via the "Micron Process."

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:10.560
In September of 2011, the Unity Government devised a colonization plan...

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:12.980
...centered upon the preservation
of the human race.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.330
In September of the next year,
the first colonial transport...

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:18.090
...the Megaroad One
began its journey.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:23.960
In September of 2030, the first of the new Macross-class transports...

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:28.080
...a gigantic vessel dwarfing its
Megaroad predecessor, departed Earth.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.440
These ships could carry in
excess of one million people.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:39.220
In 2038, the 37th colonial expedition, the
7th Macross fleet, launched from Earth orbit.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:42.020
Its destination -- the Galactic Core.

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:44.600
It is now 2045...

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:55.800
Spirit Girl

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.190
Tell me !

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.900
Why do you fly into combat and sing ?
What's your purpose ?

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.860
It's not some twisted
form of advertisement, is it ?

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:06.000
There are other ways
to advertise, you know ?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.000
Do you know what
you're saying ?

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.000
What's that
supposed to mean ?

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:13.940
Those motorcycles.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:18.410
Yeah, I saw them, but I want
to know why you do it ?

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:21.320
There's no point in singing
when there's no audience.

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:23.360
You just don't
get it, do you ?

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.860
Why do you have
to be like that ?

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:28.580
I want you to tell me
because I don't get it.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:32.110
Just shut up.
I sing when I want to.

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:34.690
What's with you ?!
You're so selfish.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.830
Why don't you explain
why you do it ?

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.300
Why that little...

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:47.090
This is Michael.
Miss Mylene is currently...

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:48.190
What is it ?

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:48.960
She's driving. Nekki Basara's with her.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.140
They're being chased.
It looks bad.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:54.110
There is no sign of the vampires...
I mean, enemy troops.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:57.240
She doesn't seem to be
in danger at this time.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.310
Don't let your guard down.
Watch them carefully.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.810
Michael.
Michael.
Don't let your guard down.
Watch them carefully.

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.100
Understood. I'll make
another report later.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.070
Michael !
Understood. I'll make
another report later.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:08.710
Johnny.
Use your head.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:11.560
There's no way I could report that
she's being chased by a motorcycle gang.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:15.110
I'm sorry. But I've lost
sight of Miss Mylene's car.

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:16.020
What ?!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.410
Did we lose them ?

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.410
Nope.

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:36.380
You think you're
pretty clever, huh ?!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.450
Did we do something ?

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.960
You're out of your league if
you think you can lose us !

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:42.990
But...

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.250
But what ?
But...

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.360
A couple of lovers fighting
during a nice afternoon drive ?

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.920
We're not
lovers fighting.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.850
Why don't you
say it out loud ?

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.690
Mumbling because
you're scared ?

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:55.440
I'm not scared !

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.280
Right, kid.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:59.210
