him to buy something for you.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:02.320
We were talking about music !
We're in a band.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.340
A band !

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:08.730
No wonder you seem
like such wimps !

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.560
Were you talking
about singing lessons ?

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.440
Haven't you ever
heard me sing ?

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.260
Nope !
Wouldn't want to either !

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.580
You should come listen to us sometime.
We're called Fire Bomber.

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:23.870
Don't make me laugh !
What's that ?

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:26.450
