00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:57.450
Let's have a good time.

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.810
So, cheers, everyone.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:06:59.810
Cheers !

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:07.210
