That'll make the rental look like small change.

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.710
Don't worry.
Right, Basara ?

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:31.110
There are now 35 victims who have
been assaulted by the unknown suspects.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:37.860
The investigation continues,
but there have been no clues as of yet.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:40.260
It is recommended that
no one walk alone at night...

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:41.910
