The missiles !

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:11.310
Oh, those. I got them
through military channels.

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:14.680
That's not what I mean !
Why were they loaded onto my Valkyrie ?!

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:16.060
Because they fit.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:16.910
What ?

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:22.010
It doesn't matter. We can't fit the Valkyrie
in here. You'll have to fly it back to City 7.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:22.860
Ray !

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:25.130
Can you do it
with that arm ?

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:29.280
Damn it !
Of course I can !

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:35.860
What the...?

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:39.220
I'll pilot
it for you.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:40.610
Why ?

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:42.910
Your arm's hurt,
isn't it ?

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:45.690
Can you operate this ?

00:21:45.690 --> 00:21:47.770
Who do you
think I am ?

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:50.190
But do you know how ?

00:21:50.190 --> 00:21:51.360
Sure.

00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:56.070
But why did you modify
it like this, anyway ?

00:21:56.070 --> 00:21:58.280
How do you know how
to operate one of these ?

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:01.640
My dad and mom used
to be ace pilots.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:07.640
Hey, Guvava seems unhappy.

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:16.830
Our voices synchronize just
like falling in love and kissing.

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.160
What's the point of singing as you're flying ?
Our voices synchronize just
like falling in love and kissing.

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:22.490
Don't you sing when
you feel like it ?

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:30.510
My heart is always here for you.

00:22:32.810 --> 00:22:44.160
But, oh !  I wonder what your
shining eyes are searching for ?

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:13.390
Our voices synchronize just like falling in love and kissing.

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:23.530
My heart is always here for you.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.700
But, oh! I wonder what your shining eyes...

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:39.680
...are searching for ? Oh, My Friends !

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:51.360
I'm going to run with you toward a star where our dreams are.

00:23:53.260 --> 00:24:03.070
When we look at each other everything will become real.

00:24:13.870 --> 00:24:17.700
Yuck ! Mom wants to set
me up with some soldier !

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:20.200
I used live ammo twice !
I'm such an idiot !

00:24:20.200 --> 00:24:21.650
Love is a battlefield !

00:24:21.650 --> 00:24:23.490
Next time,
"First Contact."

